{{High Risk|Template:Orikyoku|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Adds a compact "✨Original" badge to mark original songs (オリジナル曲) in song lists. Optionally shows a second badge naming the producer or collaborator the song was made with.

==Syntax==
{{T|Orikyoku|block=1
|v1=with =
|v2=rainbow =
}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Orikyoku|_Y_=1}}
* {{T|Orikyoku|_Y_=1|p1=with={{VLW|Kairiki Bear}}}}
* {{T|Orikyoku|_Y_=1|p1=with={{VLW|neru (producer)}}|p2=rainbow = true}}

Used in a full song list line:
<pre>* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Orikyoku|with={{VW|Kairiki Bear}}}}</pre>
* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Orikyoku|with={{VW|Kairiki Bear}}}}

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>with</code> || – || With || A producer or collaborator to credit in a second badge beside "Original". Often wrapped in {{T|VW}}. || string || – ||
